## 5. Delegation Issues

```solidity
// VULNERABLE - circular delegation
function delegate(address to) external {
    delegates[msg.sender] = to;
    // No check if `to` delegates back
}

// VULNERABLE - delegation after snapshot
function delegate(address to) external {
    // If delegation happens after proposal creation,
    // snapshot doesn't reflect new delegation
}
```

