## Governance Audit Checklist

- [ ] Voting power uses snapshots, not current balance
- [ ] Voting delay prevents frontrunning
- [ ] Quorum calculated at proposal snapshot
- [ ] Timelock cannot be bypassed
- [ ] Delegation is acyclic and snapshot-aware
- [ ] Double voting prevented
- [ ] Proposal spam mitigated
- [ ] Admin parameter changes don't affect active proposals
- [ ] Vote counting handles edge cases correctly
- [ ] Proposal execution validates proposal passed
</Parameter>
